Q: Swagger is not showing any controllers or endpoints A: <p>First, try to add swagger config like this:</p>
<pre><code>@EnableSwagger2
@Configuration
public class SwaggerConfig {


    @Bean
    public Docket productApi() {
        return new Docket(DocumentationType.SWAGGER_2)
                .select()
                .apis(RequestHandlerSelectors.basePackage(&quot;com.app&quot;))
                .paths(PathSelectors.any())
                .build();
    }

}
</code></pre>
<p>then add some annotation in your controller like this:</p>
<pre><code>package com.app.controller;

