    ResponseEntity&lt;?&gt; getAllCustomers(){


        return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.OK).body(null);
    }

    @RequestMapping(value = &quot;/customer&quot;, method = RequestMethod.POST)
    @ApiOperation(value = &quot;create&quot;, tags = &quot;customer&quot;)
    ResponseEntity&lt;?&gt; createCustomer(){


        return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.OK).body(null);
    }

}
</code></pre>
<p>hope this would fix your problem. Then try to access the url: <code>http://127.0.0.1:8080/swagger-ui/index.html</code>, pay attention not the url <code>http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html</code>.</p>

Q: React-Native-Video how to pause the video when video not in full screen or off the screen A: <p>You could check <code>viewabilityConfig</code> in <code>FlatList</code> in <code>react-native</code> to render components based on whether they are viewable in screen</p>
<pre><code>constructor(props) {
 super(props);
 this.state = {
   all_Posts: [],
   currentVisibleVideo: null,
 };
 this.viewabilityConfig = {
   itemVisiblePercentThreshold: 80,
 };
}

onViewableItemsChanged = ({ viewableItems }) =&gt; {
 if (viewableItems.length &gt; 0) {
   const visibleItem = viewableItems[0].item; // Get the first visible item
   this.setState({ currentVisibleVideo: visibleItem.id });
 } else {
   this.setState({ currentVisibleVideo: null });
 }
};


&lt;Flatlist
 ...
 &lt;Video
  ...
  paused={this.state.currentVisibleVideo !== item.id}
 &gt;&lt;/Video&gt;
 viewabilityConfig={this.viewabilityConfig}
 onViewableItemsChanged={this.onViewableItemsChanged}
&gt;&lt;/FlatList&gt;
</code></pre>

Q: JavaFX search textfield A: <p>We can make our own toolbar <a href="https://vocabhunter.github.io/2017/01/15/Search-Bar.html" rel="nofollow noreferrer" title="like this">like this</a></p>

<pre><code>&lt;ToolBar prefHeight="40.0" prefWidth="349.0" &gt;
        &lt;items&gt;
            &lt;Button fx:id="buttonCloseSearch" styleClass="buttonSearchClose"&gt;
                &lt;graphic&gt;
                    &lt;FontAwesomeIconView styleClass="buttonSearchCloseIcon" /&gt;
                &lt;/graphic&gt;
            &lt;/Button&gt;
            &lt;CustomTextField styleClass="searchField"&gt;
                &lt;left&gt;
                    &lt;Label styleClass="searchBoxLabel"&gt;
                        &lt;graphic&gt;
                            &lt;FontAwesomeIconView styleClass="searchBoxLabelIcon" /&gt;
                        &lt;/graphic&gt;
                    &lt;/Label&gt;
                &lt;/left&gt;
            &lt;/CustomTextField&gt;
            &lt;Button fx:id="buttonUpSearch" styleClass="buttonUpSearch"&gt;
                &lt;graphic&gt;
                    &lt;FontAwesomeIconView styleClass="buttonSearchUpIcon" /&gt;
                &lt;/graphic&gt;
            &lt;/Button&gt;
            &lt;Button fx:id="buttonDownSearch" styleClass="buttonDownSearch"&gt;
                &lt;graphic&gt;
                    &lt;FontAwesomeIconView styleClass="buttonSearchDownIcon" /&gt;
                &lt;/graphic&gt;
            &lt;/Button&gt;
        &lt;Label text="1 of 2 matchs" /&gt;
        &lt;/items&gt;
    &lt;/ToolBar&gt;
</code></pre>

